<title>USA: EIA Weekly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</headline>
<text>
<p>U.S. PROPANE STOCKS (IN MILLION BARRELS)</p>
<p>		05/30/97    04/30/97   04/96   03/96   Change/Mo</p>
<p>East Coast	 3.0	 3.0	2.2	  2.2    + 0.0</p>
<p>Midwest	   17.1	12.1	8.9	  7.0    + 5.0</p>
<p>Gulf Coast	18.7	16.0     13.4	 11.6    + 2.6</p>
<p>U.S. Total	40.1	32.2     25.2	 21.7    + 7.9</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Source: Estimates by U.S. Department of Energy's Energy Information Administration. Note EIA data for week of April 4, 1997, are the last data which will appear on a weekly basis until October. Beginning May 7, 1997, EIA reports will be released on a monthly basis.</p>
<p>- Totals may not equal sum of regions due to rounding.</p>
</text>
